{"node_id": "nd003", "text": "Support", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd001", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.6, "confidence_raw": 0.6, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Just feeling a bit tired lately.", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 50}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "My cat passed away last week. It’s hard.", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 70}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "forcing myself to find small joys feels forced.", "char_start": 136, "char_end": 183}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 17, "quote": "I appreciate the suggestion, but I feel like talking to others might be too much right now.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 91}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 19, "quote": "Talking to others feels too… intense.", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 110}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Not much, still feeling kind of empty without my cat around.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 60}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It's like a piece of me is missing.", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 122}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "It's starting to feel real though.", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 121}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It helps to remember the good stuff, though.", "char_start": 70, "char_end": 114}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "She really was a rock for me.", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 74}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "Thanks for listening though.", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 115}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Thinking a lot about all the good times we had.", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 86}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "Thanks for being there to listen.", "char_start": 68, "char_end": 101}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "The last few days felt long without her around. Missing her comfort.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 68}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s4", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "She used to be the first to notice when I needed a hug or just someone to sit with quietly.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 91}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s4", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "It’s just... I wish I could have said goodbye properly. Every time I look around, she’s not there.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 98}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s4", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Yeah, even small things feel off without her here. Like a quiet room feels too loud now.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 88}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261008T105418Z", "last_updated_at": "20261008T110512Z", "first_seen_session": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s4", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 4}
{"node_id": "nd004", "text": "Acknowledgment", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd001", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.6, "confidence_raw": 0.6, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Yeah, just trying to keep up.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It's just been... hard to get out of bed sometimes.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 51}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "My cat passed away last week. It’s hard.", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 70}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Not much, still feeling kind of empty without my cat around.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 60}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "But now she’s gone and... it feels different.", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 118}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Thinking a lot about all the good times we had.", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 86}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "It's starting to feel real though.", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 121}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "But it's also hard to accept she’s gone.", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 115}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "But it still hurts knowing she's not here anymore.", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 145}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "The past couple weeks have been tough. Thinking a lot about all the good times we had.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 86}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "The last few days felt long without her around. Missing her comfort.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 68}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s4", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "Those moments seem so empty now.", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 124}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s4", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "Every time I look around, she’s not there.", "char_start": 56, "char_end": 98}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s4", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "It's just… those moments used to feel complete with her. Now they feel incomplete and echo louder.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 98}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s4", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "It’s just... I wish I could have said goodbye properly. Every time I look around, she’s not there.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 98}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261008T105418Z", "last_updated_at": "20261008T110512Z", "first_seen_session": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s4", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 4}
{"node_id": "nd005", "text": "feels sadness", "depth": 0, "parent_id": null, "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.8144739234897451, "confidence_raw": 0.9, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It's just been... hard to get out of bed sometimes. Like, I miss her so much.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 77}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "It's just this emptiness inside, you know? Like, she used to be my constant. Now it's just quiet.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 97}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "The past couple weeks have been tough. Thinking a lot about all the good times we had.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 86}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It's comforting to have those good memories. She really was a rock for me. But it's also hard to accept she’s gone.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 115}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "The good memories do bring some comfort, but the sadness is still really hard to bear.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 86}, {"session_id": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "The good memories do help, but the sadness is still really intense.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 67}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261008T105450Z", "last_updated_at": "20261008T110256Z", "first_seen_session": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000564-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 2}
